window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When one of your fated mates falls victim to a sleeping curse, what can you do?</b></p> <p>Mara and her fated mates are in a race against time. One of them is still being held prisoner, and more students are falling victim to the prophecy every day, going to sleep and never waking up. Tensions are running high, and the arrival of the Nightmare King to the Wyldthorn campus doesn't help.</p> <p>Can Mara work out what she needs to do to free everyone? Will fate cut the newly formed fated mates a little slack and let them develop their relationship? Autumn is a time of fear and magic, and fear is a thick scent in the air.</p> <p>Join Mara in her race to save Forrest today.</p>"; 
